AwNjgxMTk5NzM0MTI4NjQ=",__typename:"NoteTweet",text:"$AVAX | Brief Update\n\nGreetings,\n\nAfter touching the $29.5 level I mentioned earlier, the price reached $33.5 (our target) and then sold off, executing the deviation movement we had expected.\nHowever, as far as I can see, many people are now re-evaluating the $29.5 level.\nThe $29.5 support level is correct (that's why I mentioned it earlier). However, I closed the position taken from there with a 13.5% profit. You can check the upper post that I talked about or read the notes on chart.\n\nIn this context, I wanted to provide an update to avoid any misunderstandings.\n\nCurrent Situation:\n75% of my positions (25% of it sold at $33.5 with 95% profit) held for investment purposes are still open. I will wait for the blue box to add to my positions if it comes.\nOther than that, I have no positions for intra-day or short-term trading.\n\nAs of now, those who bought at $29.5 have approximately a 4.5% profit.\nPlease continue your trades while managing your risk. Protect yourself (take profit or move stop->entry), as the market has not yet shown any signs of a reversal. \nThe red box area (the price is currently just below it) is the resistance zone.\n\nFor 🇹🇷 version: https://t.co/xM7DTty0js\n\nHave a nice week and profitable trades 🤝",entity_set:$R[294]={__ref:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzAwNjgxMTk5NzM0MTI4NjQ=:entity_set"},id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzAwNjgxMTk5NzM0MTI4NjQ="},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzAwNjgxMTk5NzM0MTI4NjQ=:entity_set":$R[295]={__id:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzAwNjgxMTk5NzM0MTI4NjQ=:entity_set",__typename:"EntitySet",hashtags:$R[296]={__refs:$R[297]=[]},symbols:$R[298]={__refs:$R[299]=["client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzAwNjgxMTk5NzM0MTI4NjQ=:entity_set:symbols:0"]},smarttags:null,urls:$R[300]={__refs:$R[301]=["client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzAwNjgxMTk5NzM0MTI4NjQ=:entity_set:urls:0"]},user_mentions:$R[302]={__refs:$R[303]=[]}},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE5NzAwNjgxMTk5NzM0MTI4NjQ=:entity_set:symbols:0":$R[304]={__id:"client:Tm